      "statusChangeID": "62842aa79646c60b7bbd0ff0",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "Right now, the git checker just looks for @\"HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\Software\\GitForWindows\" in your registry, so if you do not have this key then it will fail the test. \nWe can add a method to run `git --version` and read the output instead.\nNote that you'll need git lfs installed as well - otherwise I _think_ your version should be fine.\nAs a temp workaround, you can open `~User/Documents/VRChatCreatoCompanion/settings.json` and set `skipRequirements` to true for now.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
