      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: Alternatively one can use .reg file similar to this:\n---------------------------\nWindows Registry Editor Version 5.00\n[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\GitForWindows]\n\"CurrentVersion\"=\"2.36.0\"\n\"InstallPath\"=\"D:\\\\Programs\\\\Git\"\n\"LibexecPath\"=\"D:\\\\Programs\\\\Git\\\\mingw64\\\\libexec\\\\git-core\"\n---------------------------\nand then import it into Windows registry.",
