      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Should be fixed in version 0.2.3, available via \"Update\" button in app, or download the installer from https://vrchat.com/home/download\nInstead of checking the Windows Registry, the VCC will now run `git --version` in a background process, and consider git installed if this returns a string like \"git version 2.36.whatever\".",
